{"id":"fd9e85296ed6a24d","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-string-function-computation.md","title":"Partial String-Computable Function","display":"df-partial-string-computable-function — Partial String-Computable Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-string-function-computation","aliases":["73-df-string-function-computation","73-df-partial-string-computable-function"],"display":"df-partial-string-computable-function — Partial String-Computable Function","depends_on":["[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-string-function-computation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-string-function-computation</span><span>73-df-partial-string-computable-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-string-computable-function — Partial String-Computable Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8630ed136c8dde2d\" href=\"?note=8630ed136c8dde2d\" title=\"73-df-dtm-finite-runs\">73-df-dtm-finite-runs</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Sigma,\\Delta\\)</span> (input and output alphabets)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Delta^*\">\\(f:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Delta^*\\)</span> (partial function)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (candidate single-tape DTM)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}\">\\(C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_M^*\">\\(\\to_M^*\\)</span> (input configuration and run, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>输出子句中固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\)</span>，各分量为该元组投影，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OutputCompatible}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{OutputCompatible}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\\)</span>；在判定该性质本身时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 仍为候选参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Delta)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Delta)\\)</span>；输出子句中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\Delta^*\">\\(u\\in\\Delta^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(q,T,h)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\">\\((q,T,h)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computes}\">\\(\\operatorname{Computes}\\)</span> 本身仍对候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 定义，不把输出兼容性预设成所有候选的全局假设。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Delta^*\">\\(f:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Delta^*\\)</span> 的函数图类型由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PFun}\">\\(\\operatorname{PFun}\\)</span> 解释；不把任意多值关系作为部分函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}string\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OutputCompatible}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\n\\exists q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\\Bigl(\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\n\\land\\Delta\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}string\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OutputCompatible}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\n\\exists q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\\Bigl(\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\n\\land\\Delta\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}string\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Output}_{M,\\Delta}((q,T,h),u)\\leftrightarrow\n(q,T,h)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\n\\land q=q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\land u\\in\\Delta^*\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|u|-1\\}\\;T(i)=u(i)\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{0,\\ldots,|u|-1\\}\\;T(i)=\\mathrm{blank}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}string\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Output}_{M,\\Delta}((q,T,h),u)\\leftrightarrow\n(q,T,h)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\n\\land q=q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\land u\\in\\Delta^*\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|u|-1\\}\\;T(i)=u(i)\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{0,\\ldots,|u|-1\\}\\;T(i)=\\mathrm{blank}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}string\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M,f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\in\\{T\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{OutputCompatible}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(T)\\}\\;\\Bigl[M=S\\land\\operatorname{OutputCompatible}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(S)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall u\\in\\Delta^*\\;((w,u)\\in f\\to\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_S\\;\n(C_S^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\to_S^*C\\land\\operatorname{Output}_{S,\\Delta}(C,u)))\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(w\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\to\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_S\\;\n(C_S^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\to_S^*C\\to\\neg\\operatorname{Halting}_S(C))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}string\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M,f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\in\\{T\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{OutputCompatible}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(T)\\}\\;\\Bigl[M=S\\land\\operatorname{OutputCompatible}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(S)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall u\\in\\Delta^*\\;((w,u)\\in f\\to\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_S\\;\n(C_S^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\to_S^*C\\land\\operatorname{Output}_{S,\\Delta}(C,u)))\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(w\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\to\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_S\\;\n(C_S^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\to_S^*C\\to\\neg\\operatorname{Halting}_S(C))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}string\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\;\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M,f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}string\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\;\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M,f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The alphabet subscripts on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}\">\\(\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Output}_{M,\\Delta}\">\\(\\operatorname{Output}_{M,\\Delta}\\)</span> prevent later specializations from silently inheriting unrelated ambient alphabets.</li>\n<li>The compatibility predicate binds the output alphabet to the particular existential machine witness rather than to an unrelated ambient machine.</li>\n<li>Undefined inputs force divergence; defined inputs halt in a unique normalized output configuration because the machine is deterministic and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> is single valued.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-